- **Record.** RUNLOG l.370-500. Durable `handoff-stance5r` [measured, RUNLOG l.500]. Records PR #637, merged 2026-10-24 16:43 UTC [measured, RUNLOG l.519, l.523].

### E6. Detection tools (2026-10-23 to 2026-10-24)

- **Question.** Can every evaluation episode name its saturating actuator and sign, and can a run's history be drawn? [measured, RUNLOG l.502, l.507]
- **Design.** Code changes, report only, proved inert (training unchanged) [measured, RUNLOG l.502, l.520, l.534].
