  - THE ONE TEST: an exact one-sided permutation test of TD, PHASE against OFF. p = 1/20 only if every PHASE TD is below every OFF TD. [measured, `ST/round/criteria.txt` lines 86-125, 289-312; RUNLOG l.874, l.876]
