- **MEASURED finding after scoring.** The three OFF runs are bitwise reproductions of stance6's same-seed runs. Their ledgers have the same sha256 (`1821fd2e...`, `d1bcb789...`, `b677ce76...`), and their final policy and optimizer weights match [measured, RUNLOG l.970-971; `ST/f2/check_numbers/out/zipcrc_off_vs_stance6.out` lines 4-5, 46-47, 88-89]. Consequences [inferred, RUNLOG l.970]:
  - Training is deterministic on this Colab L4 image (the criteria assumed it was not). [inferred, RUNLOG l.970]
